# Postgres connection string from your Supabase project:
# Project Settings > Database > Connection string.
# If the backend ends up hosted somewhere serverless (e.g. Vercel functions),
# use the pooled connection string (port 6543, "Transaction" mode) instead of
# the direct one (port 5432) -- serverless invocations open many short-lived
# connections and can exhaust Postgres's connection limit against the direct
# connection.
DATABASE_URL=
